# `modes/` is an assembly directory, not a source tree.
#
# The engine repo owns `starter` (the contract baseline the deployed service
# starts on). Every other mode arrives here from a sibling mode-pack
# repository via `./eyesyctl modes sync` -- a collection of mode folders lives
# in its own repo, the way a PatchStorage upload and `/sdcard/Modes` work.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!starter/
!starter/**
